  "problem": "A wastewater basin initially holds $750\\,\\text{L}$ of water containing $6\\,\\text{kg}$ of dissolved pollutant.\nA solution containing $0.03\\,\\text{kg/L}$ of dissolved pollutant is pumped into the basin at a rate of $30\\,\\text{L/min},$ while the completely mixed liquid is drained out at a rate of $30\\,\\text{L/min}.$ Which expression gives the amount of pollutant $Q(t),$ in kilograms, in the basin $t$ minutes after pumping begins?",
